{
  "description": "Request bodies of the API and how it reads them. The cases started as a recording of the legacy zod validation of the generation requests (without the removed modelId field), with zod's issue messages; since the profile moved to PUT /api/me/profile, its cases use the profile object as the body. Cases added later (refresh, levels, illustration reviews, the rejected profile field) list the API's own messages. Invalid cases list the issues, which the API returns as error.details; the tests compare their paths.",
